{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301380","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130138001:1":{"text":"물론이죠! 자랑스러운 소렌과 아르사잖아요!","source_cn":"那当然！他们可是乌尔聚落的索恩和阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AE66EA67FD8361B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130138002:1":{"text":"둘 중 한 명만 가도 가뿐히 시련을 통과할 수 있는데, 지금은 둘이 같이 있으니까 더 이상 걱정할 필요가 없죠!","source_cn":"要我看，试炼只需要他们其中之一出马就能获胜，现在他们两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB853F4B62E982CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130138003:1":{"text":"전 그냥 옆에서 응원만 하고 있으면 돼요.","source_cn":"我只需要在一旁为他们加油欢呼就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27D715C18B088D58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血阿米库":{"text":"아미쿠","source":"小蛮血阿米库","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}